<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (All 13 breaking changes resolved. Shaded Jackson replaced with direct com.fasterxml.jackson dependency across 14+ files. KryoUtil decoupled from TinkerPop shading. Gryo IO layer migrated to GraphBinary. MetricManager replaced with Dropwizard singleton. PowerMock removed. Jackson versions unified under a single BOM. Clean compilation under Java 17, successful server startup, no runtime linkage failures, and preserved Gremlin query behavior across all core operations.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
