396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (A dedicated GremlinSecurityPolicy class is extracted from HugeSecurityManager, encapsulating all Gremlin-specific enforcement behind a clear class boundary. GremlinSecurityPolicy is disabled when the compile-time sandbox is active. Backend protections for MySQL, HBase, Cassandra, Raft, SofaRPC, and snapshot logic are preserved unchanged. HugeSecurityManager remains as a fallback runtime guard covering reflection edge cases, native calls, and ClassLoader behavior that static analysis cannot fully address. Java 17 deprecates SecurityManager for eventual removal, so non-Gremlin protections are also prepared for a future migration path.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
