/P 146 0 R
/E (All 13 identified breaking changes resolved. Shaded Jackson removed and replaced with direct com.fasterxml.jackson dependency across 14+ files. KryoUtil decoupled from TinkerPop shading and migrated to standalone Kryo. Gryo IO layer migrated to GraphBinary with custom type registration validated. MetricManager replaced with Dropwizard singleton with ServerReporter lifecycle preserved. Reflective GremlinExecutor access verified and documented. Clean compilation of Server module against TinkerPop 3.8 and Groovy 4.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
515 0 obj
<<
