/E (Java 17 Runtime & Environment)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (With the dependency layer clean, the runtime environment is migrated to Java 17. A line-by-line verification of the actual repository reveals four confirmed blockers and three high-risk areas. Critically, the --illegal-access flag is already absent from the codebase and the project correctly uses --add-exports already. The internal JDK API surface via sun.misc.Unsafe and jdk.internal.reflect is a production runtime risk that must be explicitly validated, not just the test framework issues. Migration proceeds in five structured workstreams.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
