/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (PowerMock 2.0.0-RC.3 is present in both hg-pd-test and hg-store-test with five artifacts in each. Two are explicitly compile-scoped; the remaining three rely on Maven default compile scope, which is functionally identical. All five are incompatible with the Java 17 module system because the Javassist bytecode manipulation they depend on cannot operate across module boundaries. All PowerMock usages are replaced with Mockito equivalents. This is a hard prerequisite for the PD and Store test suites to execute at all under Java 17.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
