>>
endobj
579 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (Jackson coexists at four versions with the DependencyConvergence enforcer rule explicitly commented out. Fragmented versions are a stability risk requiring alignment before the Java 17 rollout. The versions are unified under a single stable BOM. Dependency convergence enforcement is evaluated and gradually introduced to avoid breaking the build unexpectedly. RocksDB JNI at 8.10.2 in the server and 7.7.3 in the store are validated for binary compatibility with the Java 17 runtime through integration testing rather than assumed compatible.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
