/E (HugeScriptTraversal modified to use HugeGraph-managed EngineFactory instead of SingleGremlinScriptEngineManager. Custom GremlinGroovyScriptEngine factory established with CompilerConfiguration injection. SecureASTCustomizer and TypeCheckingExtension active at compile time with allowlist validated against real traversal workloads. GremlinSecurityPolicy class extracted from HugeSecurityManager with clear delegation boundary. Gremlin checks disabled when sandbox is active. Backend protections for MySQL, HBase, Raft, and SofaRPC retained via HugeSecurityManager as runtime fallback. Sandbox policy configurable via hugegraph.properties without code changes.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [18]
>>
