/E (The final phase validates the complete upgraded stack, migrates PD and Store to Java 17, stabilizes the test suite, and produces the performance comparison report. The scope is grounded in what the repository actually contains: Spring Boot 2.5.14 in both PD and Store, gRPC 1.39.0 in PD with a confirmed Java 17 compatibility gap, TinkerPop compliance tests gated to release branches only, and no existing graph benchmark harness. All of these constraints shape the actual work.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
