639 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (PD and Store currently run Spring Boot 2.5.14, which does not officially support Java 17 without workarounds. The migration path is Spring Boot 2.7.x, which is the last 2.x release with official Java 17 support, rather than Boot 3, which would require a full Jakarta namespace migration and is out of scope. The more concrete blocker is gRPC 1.39.0 in PD, which has known internal JDK API access issues on Java 17. Upgrading to gRPC 1.42+ is required before PD can run reliably on Java 17. RocksDB JNI 7.7.3 in Store is validated for binary compatibility through integration testing. All three startup scripts enforce EXPECT_JDK_VERSION=11 with no upper bound, so Java 17 passes version checks as-is, but separate RocksDB data paths must be configured for Java 11 baseline and Java 17 test environments to prevent forward-compatibility issues with RocksDB data files.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
