641 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (The run-tinkerpop-test.sh script referenced in the CI workflow does not exist in the repository. TinkerPop compliance tests are defined in hugegraph-test via ProcessStandardTest and StructureStandardTest, activated through Maven profiles, and are only executed on release-* or test-* branches. The compliance test infrastructure is restored by writing the missing script and enabling it on the Java 17 CI matrix. Unit test failures from the dependency upgrades are resolved systematically, prioritizing the Gremlin execution path, CRUD operations, and serialization behavior. Integration tests run against a live server instance to surface runtime-only failures including reflective access issues that do not appear in compilation.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
