/Title (I completed my school CS curriculum early and built a strong foundation in Java. I primarily work in Unix environments and have been using open source tools like Git and Linux in my daily workflow for the past 3+ years. My knowledge base now includes Java, C, C++, Python, and JavaScript, and I am aspiring to be tech stack agnostic. If it compiles, I can work with it.)
