/Title (Beyond coding, I've been running marathons since 10th standard, six so far, and spent time as a competitive powerlifter. My friends say I don't sleep much, which is mostly true. I'm here on a financial loan and I intend to make every hour of it count. I am not here for the stipend alone; I am here because I want to make a lasting impact on projects I believe in.)
